  eventID: MeetingRoomEntered
  dialogueLines:
  - This is the break room, where everyone comes to have a bit of a yap. No politics,
    please
  - "You\u2019ve found the break room. It\u2019s mostly for chatting, complaining,
    and absolutely no politics"
  - Ah, the break room. This is where everyone comes to have a little gossip. Keep
